                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A casual game about chess. In the first levels, you have to defend with a few pieces against a pawn invasion.\nPROS\n- very nice graphics\n- standard chess rules\n- option for fast movement\nCONS\n- no target audience : not enough attractive for casual players, too casual for chess players \n- very tedious to get the stars (broken concept ?)\n- too many levels in first campaign, this is boring\n3/10",
